        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gat I-ca-yaa ɛ nyuuth kɛ käni ji̱ A-thi-ri-ya kɛ wi̱i̱",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial ɣä jiök i̱, “Käni päm mi pat pat mi di̱i̱t kä gɔ̱ri rieet ti̱ti̱ thi̱n ɛ dho̱k i̱, ‘Duŋ Mer-ca-lal-a̱c-badh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mer-ca-lal-a̱c-badh",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kɛ thok Ɣi-bɛ-ru lotdɛ ni ɣöö mac mi pɛ̈th kɛ kuël mi pɛ̈th.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua̱ bo̱o̱th palä ni U-ri-yaa kɛnɛ Dhɛ-kar-yaa gat Yɛ-bɛ-rɛ-kiyaa cɔl ala neen kä ɣä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua̱ wä kä ciekdä, kä cuɛ ruët kä cuɛ dap kɛ gat dhöl. Kä cu Kuoth Nhial ɣä jiök i̱, “Cɔl ciötdɛ Mer-ca-lal-a̱c-badh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä ɛ ŋot /ken gat ciöt ni ŋa̱c wëë i̱, ‘Baba, kiɛ mama,’ ba ria̱ŋ Da-math-kɛth kɛnɛ pɛ̈ɛ̈c Tha-mɛ-ria naŋ ɛ kuäär A-thi-ri-ya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial ruac kɛ ɣä a te tetdɛ min bum kɛɛl kɛ ɣä, kɛ ɣöö /cä bi guɔ̱ɔ̱r ni dup nɛɛni ti̱ti̱, wëë i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luek kɛ kui̱ thiecä jɔɔkni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛnɛ, ɣän kɔnɛ gaat tin Ci Kuoth kɛ ka̱m ɣä, kɛ kɔn nyuuth rɛy I-thɛ-rɛl kä Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa, min cieŋ wi̱i̱ Pa̱a̱m Dha-yɔn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi wä naath yɛ jiök i̱, “Thiëcɛ jɔɔk kɛnɛ kolaaŋ tin kui̱w kä gi̱eer,” ɛ /ci naath dëë ku thiec ni kuothdiɛn ɛ dëë ku thiec ni mi ci li̱w, ɛ /ca dëë ku thiec ni mi tëk? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guɔ̱ɔ̱rɛ ni ŋut Kuɔth kɛnɛ ŋi̱i̱cdɛ! Kɛ thuɔ̱k ruac in lat ji̱ kolaaŋni jɛ thilɛ jɛ luɔt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn bikɛ wi̱el muun kɛ da̱k mi di̱i̱t kɛnɛ buɔth, mi wä buɔthkɛ näk bikɛ cu gaak ba guic ni nhial, kä bikɛ kuääriɛn lam kɛnɛ Kuothdiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bikɛ piny guic, kä bikɛ nɛn ni rik kɛnɛ muth kɛ da̱k mi bɛc bɛc, kä bakɛ yuɔr rɛy muɔ̱th mi col.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
